

# 1. PURPOSE

Implement the complete core **Vehicle Management** module inside the protected admin application.

Administrators must be able to create, view, edit, search, filter, activate/deactivate, and safely manage vehicles that appear in the company's inventory.

This specification establishes the core vehicle data and CRUD workflow.

**Vehicle image upload, compression, optimization, galleries, and image processing are intentionally excluded and will be implemented separately in Spec 07.**

