# 67. SECURITY TESTING

Test:

### Authentication

Unauthenticated access must fail.

### Authorization

Unauthorized users must not perform vehicle actions.

### CSRF

State-changing requests without valid CSRF must fail.

### SQL Injection

Test search, IDs, brand filters, and submitted fields.

### XSS

Test:

```text
<script>alert(1)</script>
```

and equivalent payloads in text fields.

Output must be escaped.

### ID Tampering

Attempt to edit/delete another vehicle by changing the ID.

Server-side authorization and validation must still apply.

### Method Tampering

Attempt destructive actions through GET.

They must not execute.

